35,2,1,talk,Minato,,The treasurer spent six hours a month chasing individual payments.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The ledger shows seventy percent of costs are fixed, regardless of attendance.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minako,,"Eleven mid-year joiners required manual calculations, which is inefficient.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,Turnout dropped by a third after door charges were introduced.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,A quarter of members account for two-thirds of all attendances.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Ryuji, that fixed cost ratio is significant.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Yes, it means variable charging is risky for stability.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minako,,The taster forms show people fear committing to a whole year.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,The winter social feedback confirms anxiety about per-event costs.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,The same nine people do all the setup and locking up.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minato,,Chasing money is unsustainable for a volunteer role.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,We need a structure that minimizes administrative burden.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minako,,"Tiered membership might help, but it could create friction.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,Activity-based charging seems to have hurt community feel.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"If we charge per event, the heavy users pay more, but the light users feel alienated.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minato,,I prefer a system that is easy to administer.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,A flat fee covers the fixed costs without chasing individuals.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minako,,But a flat fee might deter those who only come twice a year.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,The hesitation is real. We need to balance fairness and simplicity.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,Let us vote on what best balances these concerns.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
